   "source": [
    "# Credit Card Approval Prediction — EDA & ML Pipeline\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook performs Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA), preprocessing, feature engineering, model training, evaluation, and selection for the Credit Card Approval Prediction System.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Models compared:**\n",
    "1. Logistic Regression\n",
    "2. Decision Tree\n",
    "3. Random Forest\n",
    "4. XGBoost"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import sys, os\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, os.path.join(os.getcwd(), '..'))\n",
    "\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "sns.set_theme(style='whitegrid')\n",
    "\n",
    "from src.data_loader import generate_dataset, OUTPUT_PATH\n",
    "from src.data_preprocessing import preprocess, build_preprocessor, detect_outliers_iqr\n",
    "from src.feature_engineering import engineer_features\n",
    "from src.train import train_and_evaluate\n",
    "from src.evaluate import evaluate_all_models"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 1. Dataset Overview"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "if os.path.exists(OUTPUT_PATH):\n",
    "    df = pd.read_csv(OUTPUT_PATH)\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    df = generate_dataset()\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Rows: {len(df)}')\n",
    "print(f'Columns: {len(df.columns)}')\n",
    "df.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": ["df.info()"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": ["df.describe()"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print('Missing values:')\n",
    "print(df.isnull().sum())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 2. Target Analysis"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(6, 4))\n",
    "df['approved'].value_counts().plot(kind='bar', ax=ax, color=['#ef4444', '#10b981'])\n",
    "ax.set_title('Approval Distribution')\n",
    "ax.set_xticklabels(['Rejected', 'Approved'], rotation=0)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "print(f'Approval rate: {df[\"approved\"].mean():.1%}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 3. Numerical Analysis"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(15, 8))\n",
    "for ax, col in zip(axes.flat, ['age', 'annual_income', 'existing_debt', 'credit_history_years', 'employment_duration_years', 'credit_inquiries']):\n",
    "    ax.hist(df[col].dropna(), bins=30, color='#1d82f5', alpha=0.7)\n",
    "    ax.set_title(col)\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 4. Categorical Analysis"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "fig, axes = plt.subplots(2, 3, figsize=(15, 8))\n",
    "for ax, col in zip(axes.flat, ['income_type', 'employment_status', 'education', 'marital_status', 'housing_type', 'loan_payment_status']):\n",
    "    df.groupby(col)['approved'].mean().plot(kind='bar', ax=ax, color='#10b981')\n",
    "    ax.set_title(f'Approval Rate by {col}')\n",
    "    ax.set_ylabel('Approval Rate')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 5. Correlation Analysis"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "numeric_df = df.select_dtypes(include=[np.number])\n",
    "fig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(10, 8))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(numeric_df.corr(), annot=True, fmt='.2f', cmap='coolwarm', ax=ax)\n",
    "ax.set_title('Correlation Heatmap')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": ["## 6. Preprocessing & Feature Engineering"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
